75
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:04,984
Aku bedalah.

76
00:08:05,067 --> 00:08:08,571
Pertama, aku nggak suka
laki-laki lemah dan nggak sekaya aku.

77
00:08:08,654 --> 00:08:09,447
DNA-ku udah gitu.

78
00:08:10,406 --> 00:08:12,116
Oh? Heh, dia datang.

79
00:08:40,645 --> 00:08:42,647
Jangan sampai mereka tersinggung.

80
