Tadi Choi Yun-seok bilang kamu nggak boleh
ngomong sama aku. Kamu bisa denger dia,

128
00:12:08,978 --> 00:12:09,812
kan?

129
00:12:10,062 --> 00:12:11,147
Dasar… Dasar berengsek!

130
00:12:15,109 --> 00:12:17,903
Chan-min, kalau kamu mau
mukul, harusnya jangan mukul aku.

131
00:12:17,987 --> 00:12:18,821
Hei!

132
00:12:19,238 --> 00:12:20,698
-Harusnya kamu mukul Choi Yun-seok, kan?
-Hei!

133
00:12:20,781 --> 00:12:23,743
