Kalau cuma itu, aku bisa urus sendiri kok.

165
00:14:23,612 --> 00:14:24,697
Aku juga…

166
00:14:26,615 --> 00:14:27,491
suka sikap kamu.

167
00:14:29,201 --> 00:14:30,744
Waktu aku nyium kamu.

168
00:14:31,954 --> 00:14:34,290
Soalnya kamu sama sekali nggak ngelawan.

169
00:14:34,540 --> 00:14:35,457
Aku suka itu.

170
00:14:45,634 --> 00:14:49,972
Aku suka banget cerita cinta yang
nggak mandang batasan status kayak gini.

171
00:14:50,723 --> 00:14:54,018
Tapi kenapa kamu pilih
Jae-i? Kan ada banyak cewek lain.

172
00:14:54,101 --> 00:14:54,852
Dia cantik.

173
00:14:55,853 --> 00:14:56,353
Apa?

174
00:14:58,105 --> 00:14:59,440
Dia yang paling cantik.

175
00:15:00,065 --> 00:15:00,983
Waktu itu.

176
00:15:02,443 --> 00:15:03,819
Dari semua cewek lain.

177
00:15:08,657 --> 00:15:09,742
Cuma itu?

178
00:15:11,619 --> 00:15:14,872
Kamu berani kehilangan
nyawa, cuma karena dia cantik?

179
00:15:29,845 --> 00:15:31,472
Aku harus ngelakuin sesuatu.

180
00:15:32,181 --> 00:15:33,015
Maaf ya.

181
00:15:33,974 --> 00:15:34,934
Apa pun itu.

182
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:37,144
Pokoknya maafin aku.

183
00:15:51,742 --> 00:15:53,452
Gimana? Keren, kan?

184
00:15:55,162 --> 00:15:56,330
Cocok banget.

185
00:15:56,413 --> 00:15:58,332
Masuk cepetan. Aku sopirin kamu.

186
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:00,209
Berangkat?

187
00:16:08,634 --> 00:16:09,718
Aku rekam lho.

188
00:16:27,861 --> 00:16:28,779
Makan apa nih?

189
00:16:29,321 --> 00:16:30,489
Es krim.

190
00:16:30,572 --> 00:16:34,034
-Makan sendirian? Kok sendoknya satu?
-Ini, ini, aku bagi.

191
00:16:34,994 --> 00:16:35,536
"Ah."

192
00:16:36,578 --> 00:16:38,080
Deketan dong biar aku suapin.

193
00:16:39,790 --> 00:16:41,542
-Ayo.
-Yang bener dong!

194
00:16:41,625 --> 00:16:42,418
Heh!

195
00:16:42,501 --> 00:16:43,502
Kamu ya!

196
00:16:45,462 --> 00:16:46,338
Dasar…

197
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:51,719
Nyerah nggak?

198
00:16:51,802 --> 00:16:54,013
Jangan macam-macam sama makanan orang.

199
00:16:54,096 --> 00:16:55,597
Kamu pilih es krim atau aku?

200
00:16:56,181 --> 00:16:57,307
Es krim.

201
00:16:57,391 --> 00:16:58,392
Awas ya.

202
00:16:59,727 --> 00:17:00,728
Sini suapin lagi.

203
00:17:03,439 --> 00:17:04,273
"Ah."

204
00:17:04,398 --> 00:17:06,984
Ayo "ah" lagi. Deketan
biar aku bisa suapin.

205
00:17:08,444 --> 00:17:09,611
Ah, sini!

206
00:17:09,695 --> 00:17:11,030
Minta maaf nggak?

207
00:17:11,113 --> 00:17:12,156
Iya, iya. Maaf.

208
00:17:12,239 --> 00:17:13,824
-Ngaku salah?
-Iya, aku ngaku salah.

209
00:17:13,907 --> 00:17:14,950
Eh, tunggu deh.

210
00:17:15,034 --> 00:17:15,784
Apa?

211
00:17:16,326 --> 00:17:18,328
Kamu mukulin aku cuma gara-gara makanan?

212
00:17:18,412 --> 00:17:21,248
-Ya salah kamu sendiri.
-Pilih es krim atau aku nih?

213
00:17:21,331 --> 00:17:22,791
-Ya, jelaslah…
-Jelas apa?

214
00:17:22,875 --> 00:17:23,917
-Jelas aja…
-Apa?

215
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:25,711
-Es krim.
-Jangan bilang kamu mau nangis.

216
00:17:25,794 --> 00:17:27,087
Kemari. Hei!

217
00:17:28,797 --> 00:17:32,259
Kamu emang pacar yang romantis.
Tapi lama-lama nggak menarik.

218
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:39,975
Aku lihat Jae-i di luar hotel.

219
00:17:47,691 --> 00:17:51,278
Kamu nggak denger aku bilang
apa, ya? Aku bilang, nggak menarik.

220
00:17:51,361 --> 00:17:54,907
Lagian, Jae-i tuh paling nggak
suka sama orang yang baperan.

221
